1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,787
October 6th, 2018. Las Vegas.

2
00:00:03,087 --> 00:00:04,772
Khabib versus McGregor, at last.

3
00:00:05,572 --> 00:00:08,111
At the press conference, Conor did most of the talking.

4
00:00:08,411 --> 00:00:12,315
In the build-up, Conor took aim at Khabib's family, his team, and his beliefs.

5
00:00:12,615 --> 00:00:13,660
Khabib stayed calm.

6
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,999
In the cage, Khabib took Conor down again and again.

7
00:00:17,299 --> 00:00:20,029
In round four, he locked in a neck crank. Conor tapped.

8
00:00:20,829 --> 00:00:26,611
Khabib was still unbeaten. But then, he climbed over the fence, and jumped at Conor's teammate, Dillon Danis.

9
00:00:26,911 --> 00:00:30,921
At the same time, members of Khabib's team got into the cage, and hit Conor.

10
00:00:31,221 --> 00:00:32,779
Security pulled everyone apart.

11
00:00:33,579 --> 00:00:37,824
Khabib was suspended for nine months, and fined five hundred thousand dollars.

12
00:00:38,124 --> 00:00:40,257
Conor got six months, and fifty thousand.

13
00:00:40,557 --> 00:00:42,989
Two of Khabib's teammates were suspended for a year.

14
00:00:43,789 --> 00:00:50,488
In 2020, Khabib retired, undefeated at 29 and 0. He left his gloves in the middle of the cage.

15
00:00:50,788 --> 00:00:53,327
He said he'd promised his mother it was his last fight.

16
00:00:54,127 --> 00:00:55,748
The feud? It still goes on online.

17
00:00:56,048 --> 00:00:57,456
Follow for more fight history.

